# TiXL party backend. The public entry is party.php.
# PHP OPcache keys on the file path, so never overwrite a deployed file in place -
# upload the next build under a new name (party2.php, party3.php, ...) and update
# the URL in Settings > Collaboration > Advanced (Backend URL).
#
# data/ holds the SQLite database and is not reachable over the web.
